  "id": "agritechnica-asia-2020-with-doubled-exhibition-space",
  "title": "AGRITECHNICA ASIA 2020 with doubled exhibition space",
  "date": "2019-10-09T09:03:05+07:00",
  "category": "announcement",
  "excerpt": "AGRITECHNICA ASIA will return to Bangkok from 7-9 May 2020. With the co-location to Systems & Components Asia and Horti Asia, it will be the central platform for decision-makers from the farming sector in Asia-Pacific. If you want to become part of the AGRITECHNICA ASIA community and secure your company a good stand location, we are happy",
  "image": false,
  "featured": false,
  "author": "admin",
  "html": "<p><b><a href=\"http://www.agritechnica-asia.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://rdir.inxmail.com/dlg/d?o0004g4q00lemu00d0000kr0000000000dyozqqgo3jed0df53jjch5jxb4611&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1570671527538000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGVP2ifbAgn-Akgl10nJJyRvNPqmg\">AGRITECHNICA ASIA</a></b>&nbsp;will return to&nbsp;<b>Bangkok</b>&nbsp;from&nbsp;<b>7-9 May 2020</b>. With the co-location to&nbsp;<b><a href=\"http://www.agritechnica-asia.com/systems-and-components-asia/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://rdir.inxmail.com/dlg/d?o0004hp000lemu00d0000kr0000000000dyozqqgo3jed0df53jjch5lz4u611&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1570671527538000&amp;usg=AFQjCNHyDcLVxC7RFYw1BXInALqycEsRiA\">Systems &amp; Components Asia</a></b>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<b><a href=\"http://www.horti-asia.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://rdir.inxmail.com/dlg/d?o0004g4y00lemu00d0000kr0000000000dyozqqgo3jed0df53jjch5ou04611&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1570671527539000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGNnWgTsbG7513wXJl05ud4aYcPeg\">Horti Asia</a></b>, it will be the central platform for decision-makers from the farming sector in Asia-Pacific.</p>\n<p>If you want to become part of the AGRITECHNICA ASIA community and secure your company a good stand location, we are happy to consult you personally regarding your individual participation.</p>\n<p>&gt;&gt;&nbsp;<b><a href=\"http://www.agritechnica-asia.com/contactus/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://rdir.inxmail.com/dlg/d?o0004g7i00lemu00d0000kr0000000000dyozqqgo3jed0df53jjch5m0gy611&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1570671527539000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFd-sT17f8yZtVzfs90g5tFQoSbRg\">Find your personal consultant from your region</a></b><br />\n&gt;&gt;&nbsp;<b><a href=\"http://www.agritechnica-asia.com/wp-uploads/2019/01/AGRITECHNICA-ASIA-2020_Application-Form_Early-Bird_290818.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://rdir.inxmail.com/dlg/d/d.pdf?o0004g5000lemu00d0000kr0000000000dyozqqgo3jed0df53jjch5l5h4611&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1570671527539000&amp;usg=AFQjCNH6102MR62xIHNxnGZLmbcw0m904Q\">Application form</a></b></p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/oln-SlzZoEDheKOnCk763dLlwJTK2dOHIzbZrCVrwuEjxPaUAGiLGSRtHY5ygxB0ldCM6UIwOA8cSavRTgz5JxoYaeudD_yJHukB=s0-d-e1-ft#https://www.agritechnica.com/fileadmin/img/inxmail/1.jpg\"><strong>Strong Partners<br />\n</strong>AGRITECHNICA ASIA takes advantage of the support of ministries and regional agricultural organizations. Leading global companies such as AGCO, Fliegl, KUHN and Maschio Gaspardo have already confirmed their participation.<strong><br />\n</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>&gt;&gt;&nbsp;<b><a href=\"mailto:K.Staske@DLG.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Request floorplan</a></b></p></blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/awuvF8c31wa6m74BJUVvykwRaFn0Ar9L9VujaHNMYQ9d3eOkL3c2Hf06r25WS8pji2hxNI3zf2R5OgmaPuBlHV3dI3w2db1RT6cms5geIliyq-vZpQLKo_1OnY3BcStjhCGON6Ae99uzpHZW5Nq2cVTJE9GyPg=s0-d-e1-ft#https://rdir.inxmail.com/dlg/d/d.jpg?o0004g7y00lemu00h0000kr0000000000dyozqqgo3jed0df53jjch5oype611\"><strong>Top Buyers and Influencers</strong><br />\nConnect with your future customers already before the exhibition: We are going to host more than 500 top buyers and influencers from leading agricultural businesses to Bangkok. Test our Match-and-Meet program and get in touch with buyers, who are interested in your product.</p>\n<blockquote><p>&gt;&gt;&nbsp;<b><a href=\"http://www.agritechnica-asia.com/visiting/#anchor_buyer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://rdir.inxmail.com/dlg/d?o0004g7q00lemu00d0000kr0000000000dyozqqgo3jed0df53jjch5nffy611&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1570671527539000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGn-mbJvKc8h-Xc-htC7B5QJAbgcg\">Hosted Buyer Program</a></b></p></blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft\" src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/oxIICTq53ldBouqVoQk-xBnSWXR95YyiIpqzbbu2uwDVjQqGA40cUMxw2g7-Z2aGpp8h1SzpvIXDKkpc6-j18ny6CVzaAC85DMToJwSupAuY70ICNzUpi8v2GRQV1TEbXQQZnvaOpofHELJRYRuHQw1nv3TsUQ=s0-d-e1-ft#https://rdir.inxmail.com/dlg/d/d.jpg?o0004h0000lemu00h0000kr0000000000dyozqqgo3jed0df53jjch5jrtu611\"><strong>Value for Budget Planner</strong><br />\nPut the benefits of exhibiting at AGRITECHNICA ASIA into perspective: Identify the potential of your trade fair participation and associated costs in just 5 steps.</p>\n<blockquote><p>&gt;&nbsp;<b><a href=\"http://www.agritechnica-asia.com/exhibiting/#anchor_rates\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://rdir.inxmail.com/dlg/d?o0004h0i00lemu00d0000kr0000000000dyozqqgo3jed0df53jjch5kmzi611&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1570671527539000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEc8hHMl-si9TuKgz43RHwGx7pk4A\">Value for Budget Planner</a></b></p></blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n<div class=\"qrcswholewtapper\" style=\"text-align:left;\">\n<div class=\"qrcprowrapper\"  id=\"qrcwraa139leds\">\n<div class=\"qrc_canvass\" id=\"qrc_cuttenpages_139\" style=\"display:inline-block\" data-text=\"https://www.tsae.asia/agritechnica-asia-2020-with-doubled-exhibition-space/\"></div>\n<div><a download=\"AGRITECHNICA ASIA 2020 with doubled exhibition space.png\" class=\"qrcdownloads\" id=\"worign\"><br />\n           <button type=\"button\" style=\"min-width:200px;background:#dddddd;color:#000;font-weight: 600;border: 1px solid #dddddd;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px;padding: 6px 0;\" class=\"uqr_code_btn\">QRCode 2 Me</button><br />\n           </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
